OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPatchy rain
OL,6,Fturning heavy by late evening, then
OL,7,Fclearing to only a few light showers
OL,8,Fovernight. Brisk southerly winds
OL,9,Freaching gale force in the west.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTuesday:FA mix of scattered showers
OL,12,Fand brighter spells during the
OL,13,Fmorning. Outbreaks building for the
OL,14,Fafternoon, bringing the risk of
OL,15,Fthunderstorms in the west late
OL,16,Fafternoon. Brisk southwest winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
